{{ template "chart.description" . }}

Part of [ci-accelerator](https://github.com/hoobiboobi/ci-accelerator); this chart is the daemons alone, for a cluster that already has a runner. Every CI job talks to the daemon on its own node (`routing: PreferSameNode`), so a project's cache stays warm on that node; mTLS between jobs and daemons is mandatory (cert-manager or your own certificates); the garbage-collection policies are rendered in full by the chart (see `config.gc`).

```sh
helm install buildkit oci://ghcr.io/hoobiboobi/charts/buildkit --version <version> \
  -n ci-accelerator --set 'tls.client.namespaces={ci-jobs}'
```

The box ([charts/ci-accelerator](https://github.com/hoobiboobi/ci-accelerator/tree/main/charts/ci-accelerator)) installs this chart with a gitlab-runner and the console. How to use the daemons from a job, where the cache should live and what to watch: the [documentation](https://ci-accelerator.io/docs/), [architecture](https://ci-accelerator.io/docs/architecture/) and [troubleshooting](https://ci-accelerator.io/docs/troubleshooting/).

